wine bottles while keeping them organized and within easy reach.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\",\n        \"value\": \"Space-Saving Wall Mounted Storage: Make the most of your wall space with this stylish wine bottle holder, ideal for home bars, kitchens, dining rooms, wine cellars, restaurants, cafes, and entertainment areas.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\",\n        \"value\": \"Strong & Durable Construction: Built with sturdy craftsmanship to securely hold standard-sized wine bottles, providing reliable stability and long-lasting performance for everyday use.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\",\n        \"value\": \"Modern Home Decor & Thoughtful Gift: Designed to complement modern, minimalist, contemporary, and industrial interiors, this wooden wine bottle organizer is a perfect gift for wine lovers, new homeowners, weddings, birthdays, anniversaries, and other special occasions.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\",\n        \"value\": \"Available in Natural & Walnut Finishes: Choose between a Natural Pine Wood finish for a bright, organic look or a Walnut finish for a rich, sophisticated appearance to match your home decor.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/brand\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"Woodwolf\",\n        \"language_tag\": \"en_IN\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/attributes/external_product_information\",\n    \"value\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"44199090\",\n        \"entity\": \"HSN Code\",\n        \"marketplace_id\": \"A21TJRUUN4KGV\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\":